{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/BossShotGIF.gif?t=1748965085\" />The Shadow Beneath is an action roguelike where you must fulfill an ancient prophecy and rise against the demonic forces that have taken over the world. You will battle relentless waves of enemies, master powerful abilities and reclaim what humanity lost since the Demon Lords reign began - freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/Do_you_have_what_it_takes_.png?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Amon, the half-demon savior, on a brutal journey to slay the demon lord Apophis.</strong><br>Dive into the cursed pyramids and fight your way through ancient dungeons crawling with demonic horrors. Every room is a test of your reflexes, every enemy a threat. Survive traps, crush monsters, and rise through the depths \u2014 or die trying.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/TheShadowBeneathFightingTest.gif?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/Build_Like_a_Madman.png?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No two runs play the same.</strong><br>Pick up a wild arsenal of active skills and passive upgrades \u2014 then create deadly combos on the fly. Will you be a glass cannon dashing into chaos, or a master of control who kites enemies into traps?<br><br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/TheShadowBeneathSkillsMenu.gif?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/High-Skill_Carnage.png?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This isn\u2019t just another auto-attacker. Your aim, timing and movement matters.</strong>  <br>Dodge through waves of enemies, chain skills with perfect precision and turn tight fights into stylish victories. The deeper you go, the faster and meaner everything gets \u2014 and only the most skilled make it to the end.<strong>  </strong>  <br>If you love games that reward fast thinking and tighter execution, you\u2019ll feel right at home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/Handcrafted_Hell.png?t=1748965085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every room is built with intention!</strong><br>We've designed more than 15 unique room layouts packed with traps, enemy ambushes and unexpected challenges. On each run, you'll face a fresh mix of these handcrafted encounters, keeping you on your toes without sacrificing flow or balance.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/PuzzleShotGIF.gif?t=1748965085\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/extras/mummyGIF.gif?t=1748965085\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389620?t=1748965085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/91c9016b68711f709fc03cf5c0e5223e731f98b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748965085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/16b77ed9f65c646c3ddf6b6e276e5c2b92dbae67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748965085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389620/16b77ed9f65c646c3ddf6b6e276e5c2b92dbae67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=